{"id":"q9ea8ff111d","q":"This could have worked if I _______ been more far-sighted.","o":["have","had","might","would"],"a":1,"e":"বাক্যটি Third Conditional-এর। এখানে অতীতে ঘটেনি এমন একটি শর্তের কথা বলা হচ্ছে। এই ধরনের বাক্যে main clause-এ would/could/might have + past participle থাকে, আর if clause-এ থাকে had + past participle। এখানে main clause 'could have worked', তাই if clause-এ had been বসবে। সঠিক বাক্য: This could have worked if I had been more far-sighted।<br>উদাহরণ:<br>If she had studied, she would have passed.","s":"ইংরেজি ভাষা ও সাহিত্য","qn":49,"t":"Conditional","x":"৪৫তম বিসিএস"},
